---
import Entry from '../../../../../layouts/Entry.astro';
import Faq from '../../../../../components/registry/Faq.astro';
import ScDossierTable from '../../../../../components/registry/ScDossierTable.astro';
import '../../../../../styles/registry-wave1.css';
import { absolute, url } from '../../../../../lib/site';
import { faqNode, hubNodes, count, WAVE1_BASE } from '../../../../../lib/registry-wave1';
import { wave1b, sentence, shortSlug, scDossierPath, SC_BASE, WAVE1B_DATA_PATH } from '../../../../../lib/registry-wave1b';

export function getStaticPaths() {
  return wave1b().scPurposeHubs.map((label) => ({ params: { purpose: shortSlug(label) }, props: { label } }));
}

const { label } = Astro.props as { label: string };
const w = wave1b();
const items = w.scByPurpose.get(label)!;
const faqs = w.scPurposeFaqs(label, items);
const canonical = new URL(Astro.url.pathname, Astro.site).toString();
const origin = absolute('/', Astro.site);
const reg = w.src.oscrRegister;
const title = `${sentence(label)}: Scotland charity dossiers`;
const description = `${count(items.length)} Wave 1b dossiers and ${count(w.scHubs.purposes[label])} registered charities listing the OSCR purpose “${label}”. Figures as published by the Scottish Charity Regulator.`;
const jsonLd = [
  ...hubNodes({
    name: title, description, canonical, origin, dateModified: w.manifest.edition,
    items: items.map((d) => ({ name: d.name, url: absolute(scDossierPath(d.number), Astro.site) })),
    spatialCoverage: 'Scotland',
    dataFiles: [absolute(`${WAVE1B_DATA_PATH}scotland-dossiers.json`, Astro.site), absolute(`${WAVE1B_DATA_PATH}scotland-hubs.json`, Astro.site)],
    isBasedOn: [reg.url, w.src.oscrReturns.url],
    license: reg.licence,
    creditText: reg.attribution,
  }),
  faqNode(faqs),
];
const sources = [
  { title: 'Download the Scottish Charity Register', publisher: reg.publisher, url: reg.page },
  { title: `Scottish Charity Register download (${reg.member})`, publisher: reg.publisher, url: reg.url, note: `dated ${w.registerDate}; SHA-256 ${reg.sha256}` },
  { title: 'Open Government Licence v3.0', publisher: 'The National Archives', url: reg.licence },
];
---

<Entry
  title={title}
  eyebrow="Verified registry hub · Scotland"
  identityCode="OSCR purpose"
  summary={`Scottish charities that list the purpose “${label}”, and the ${count(items.length)} Wave 1b dossiers among them, listed alphabetically.`}
  description={description}
  crumbs={[
    { label: 'The Record', href: '/record/' },
    { label: 'Charity dossiers', href: WAVE1_BASE },
    { label: 'Scotland', href: SC_BASE },
    { label: sentence(label) },
  ]}
  sources={sources}
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
  sections={[
    { slug: 'register-counts', text: 'Register counts', symbol: 'bars' },
    { slug: 'dossiers', text: 'Wave 1b dossiers', symbol: 'folder' },
    { slug: 'questions', text: 'Questions answered from the record', symbol: 'question' },
    { slug: 'limits', text: 'Sources and limits', symbol: 'alert' },
  ]}
>
  <p>The Scottish Charity Register records which of 16 charitable purposes each charity pursues. This hub groups Wave 1b dossiers by the purpose “{label}”, exactly as the register words it. It does not rank, rate or endorse any charity.</p>

  <h2 id="register-counts">Register counts</h2>
  <dl class="rw-facts">
    <dt>Charities listing this purpose</dt><dd>{count(w.scHubs.purposes[label])}</dd>
    <dt>All charities in the register download</dt><dd>{count(w.scHubs.registerRows)}</dd>
    <dt>Wave 1b dossiers listing this purpose</dt><dd>{count(items.length)}</dd>
    <dt>Register download</dt><dd>Dated {w.registerDate}</dd>
  </dl>
  <p>A charity can list several purposes, so counts across purposes overlap. Other purposes: {w.scPurposeHubs.filter((p) => p !== label).map((p, i) => <>{i > 0 && ' · '}<a href={url(w.scPurposePath(p))}>{sentence(p)}</a></>)}. Compare comparable labels in other registers on the <a href={url('/record/charity-dossiers/cause-by-country/')}>Cause × Country</a> page.</p>

  <h2 id="dossiers">Wave 1b dossiers</h2>
  <ScDossierTable items={items} caption={`Wave 1b dossiers listing “${label}”. Pounds sterling as published in OSCR’s five-year return export.`} />

  <Faq faqs={faqs} />

  <h2 id="limits">Sources and limits</h2>
  <p>Counts include every charity in the register download dated {w.registerDate}. Dossiers include charities whose latest included annual return in the committed OSCR edition of {w.scEdition} reports gross income of at least {w.scThreshold}. Totals are not added across charities because group accounts and cross-border registrations can overlap.</p>
  <p>{reg.attribution} <a href={url(`${WAVE1B_DATA_PATH}scotland-hubs.json`)} download="charitology-scotland-registry-hubs.json">Download the hub counts</a> or the <a href={url(`${WAVE1B_DATA_PATH}manifest.json`)} download="charitology-registry-wave1b-manifest.json">Wave 1b manifest</a>.</p>
</Entry>
